# YoRHa-OS boot sound (spec 013). When the sound card is complete (the card's change event with
# SOUND_INITIALIZED, set by 78-sound-card.rules on the cardN device, not the controlC one), ask systemd
# for the sound. The unit is Type=simple with nothing ordered after it: the boot never waits for it.
SUBSYSTEM=="sound", KERNEL=="card*", ACTION=="change", ENV{SOUND_INITIALIZED}=="1", TAG+="systemd", ENV{SYSTEMD_WANTS}+="yorha-os-boot-sound.service"
